### ================================
### ADMIN ROUTES (/admin-api)
### Login as ADMIN first
### ================================

### Get admin dashboard (stats + user list)
GET http://localhost:5000/admin-api/dashboard

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:5000/admin-api/users

### Get system settings
GET http://localhost:5000/admin-api/settings

### Update system settings — disable trading
PUT http://localhost:5000/admin-api/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tradingEnabled": false
}

### Update system settings — enable trading
PUT http://localhost:5000/admin-api/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tradingEnabled": true,
    "maintenanceMode": false,
    "defaultBalance": 10000,
    "transactionFeePercent": 1
}

### Update system settings — maintenance mode ON
PUT http://localhost:5000/admin-api/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "maintenanceMode": true
}

### View all transactions (system-wide)
GET http://localhost:5000/admin-api/transactions

### Block a user (replace <USER_ID>)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/admin-api/users/<USER_ID>/block

### Unblock a user
PATCH http://localhost:5000/admin-api/users/<USER_ID>/unblock